-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Inn teleports: one spell per inn, filed under the Adventuring skill (795).
--
-- GENERATED by gen_inns.py from inns.py - do not edit by hand.
-- Run against tw_world. IDEMPOTENT. Needs a mangosd RESTART and a rebuilt patch-6.mpq.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Each spell is cloned from 3561 (Teleport: Stormwind), which already casts for ten
-- seconds, breaks on damage and has no cooldown. The destination is NOT in the spell -
-- it is a row in spell_target_position keyed by spell id, which is how 63 spells share
-- one template and still land in 63 different places.
--
-- You are not taught these. Walk into an inn and lua_scripts/inn_discovery.lua gives you
-- that one, so the tab fills in as you see the world rather than arriving complete.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

USE tw_world;

